abstract: >-
  An R package providing a support-safe shifted three-parameter log-logistic
  family for classic GAMLSS, with stationary and validated scale- and
  shape-covariate models and an operational calendar-month LL3-SPEI workflow.
keywords:
  - GAMLSS
  - log-logistic distribution
  - non-stationarity
  - SPEI
  - drought index
